guide forever/horde/30-40/01-desolace
title Desolace & Hillsbrad Foothills
faction Horde
levels 30-33
zone Desolace
next forever/horde/30-40/02-stranglethorn-vale

# Consensus route (Horde Tauren export), visits 16-23 (Orgrimmar 30.4 to
# Alterac Mountains 32.9) of the export it was written from, shared by every
# Horde start. The October refresh's export (visits 16-21: Dustwallow 30.4,
# Thunder Bluff, Orgrimmar, Desolace 30.8-32.3, Hillsbrad, Alterac 32.9) has
# the same Desolace and Hillsbrad quests; the notes below say where it
# differs. Forever above 30 cannot be checked in game until launch on 4
# November: this guide follows the data, not play.
#
# Flow: Freewind Post (where the previous guide ends) -> fly to Orgrimmar
# (Alliance Relations, training) -> fly to Sun Rock Retreat -> ride into
# Desolace -> Gizelton caravan -> Scrabblescrew's Camp and Ghost Walker Post
# -> Kodo Graveyard -> Kolkar Village -> Sargeron -> Thunder Axe Fortress ->
# Ghost Walker Post -> Kolkar ears and Sargeron again -> Ghost Walker Post ->
# Shadowprey Village (flight path) -> clam beds -> Sar'theris Strand -> Ethel
# Rethor and the Burning Blade Seer -> Ghost Walker Post -> grind at the
# Gelkis Village -> Shadowprey -> fly to Orgrimmar (training) -> zeppelin to
# the Undercity -> fly to Tarren Mill (bind) -> the Hillsbrad coast (Elixir
# of Agony) -> Tarren Mill -> the Shindigger keg -> hearth to Tarren Mill ->
# Valik's camp and the Syndicate -> the yeti caves -> the Dalaran crater ->
# Tarren Mill -> Strahnbrad (Gol'dir) -> Tarren Mill -> fly to the
# Undercity, where the next guide takes the Grom'gol zeppelin.
#
# Optional extras:
# - Bodyguard for Hire (5821): the Gizelton caravan runs on a timer; escort
#   it if it waits by the road on the way in, otherwise ride on.
# - The Corrupter (1480-1484): the Flayed Demon Skin that starts it drops at
#   1-5% from the Burning Blade; the follow-ups (scalp, Oracle Crystal) are
#   done only if it drops.
# - Elixir of Agony (515, 517, 524): needs a Strong Troll's Blood Potion, an
#   Alchemy item no vendor sells. Without one, skip the whole chain.
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - Stranglethorn: the old export's first stop there (level 30.4: Welcome to
#   the Jungle 583, Tiger Mastery 185, Panther Mastery 190, the Booty Bay
#   flight path) is merged into the Stranglethorn visit of the next guide;
#   the refreshed export now does the same.
# - The Thunder Bluff stop (refreshed export visit 17, before Orgrimmar) is
#   dropped: a flight detour for small hand-ins, Sacred Fire (5062), Melor
#   Sends Word (1130) and Steelsnap (1131). It also accepts The Sacred Flame
#   (1195), which the export never turns in. Druids and Paladins still fly
#   there to train (below).
# - Stonetalon and the Undercity hand-in (the old export's visits 20-21)
#   stay dropped, and the refreshed export drops them too: Test of Lore
#   (1152, 1154, 6627, 1159) needs the Legacy of the Aspects from
#   south-eastern Ashenvale, two Talondeep Path crossings from Braug
#   Dimspirit, for under a tenth of a level. Ordanus (1088) is only accepted
#   there.
# - Hillsbrad: the refreshed export also runs Elixir of Agony (509, 513),
#   Dangerous! (567) and Battle of Hillsbrad (539) here; forever/horde/06-
#   hillsbrad-foothills already does them around level 23.
# - Centaur clans dropped: Magram Alliance and Gelkis Alliance (1367, 1368)
#   need Friendly standing, earned only by killing the rival clan (+20 per
#   kill, and -100 with the clan you kill), so the export's plan to serve
#   both clans cannot work; their follow-ups Broken Tears (1369), Stealing
#   Supplies (1370), Gizmo for Warug (1371, an Engineering target dummy),
#   Khan Shaka (1375) and Ongeku (1373, only accepted) go with them. Forever
#   continues both chains from Valley of Bones (93034 and on), which need
#   Honored: left out too, see forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh.
# - Shadowprey bind and hearth dropped: the ride from Ghost Walker Post back
#   to Shadowprey runs past the Gelkis grind, and the hearth stays free for
#   the Hillsbrad keg.
# - A grind to 32 at the Gelkis Village replaces the dropped quests' XP.
# - Prison Break In (544) and Stone Tokens (556) are handed in at Tarren
#   Mill on the way out: the export does their objectives but never returns
#   them, and the route flies from Tarren Mill anyway. For the same reason
#   Blackmoore's Legacy (506) is handed in there now instead of on a later
#   Tarren Mill visit.
# - Helcular's Revenge part 2 (553) is not taken: the export leaves it open,
#   and Helcular's grave is in Southshore's graveyard.
# - Blood in the Streets (92434) and Key to the City (93680), which the
#   refreshed export takes at Tarren Mill, stay out: they lead into the new
#   City of Dalaran dungeon (wowforevertalents.com: the Grimy Key from the
#   internment camp opens its sewers), the data has no place for the Grimy
#   Key and no XP for 93680, and 92434 (270 XP) ends at the sewer entrance
#   on Lordamere Lake's Silverpine shore, off this route.
# - Warsong Supplies (6571): the export lists its objectives here but never
#   turns it in; left out. Alliance Relations part 4 (1436) is only accepted.
#
# Class quests (a short Shaman hop from Orgrimmar before Sun Rock Retreat):
# - Shaman: Call of Air (1531) from Searn Firewarder in Orgrimmar to Prate
#   Cloudseer by Freewind Post (Air Totem). Call of Water: Islen Waterseer
#   south of Ratchet takes the Vial of Purest Water (220, from Brine) and
#   sends you to Silverpine (63): from the Undercity stop, fly to the
#   Sepulcher, beat the Corrupt Manifestation of Water at the Brazier of
#   Everfount and take the Shard of Water (100, 96) back to Islen from
#   Stranglethorn (forever/horde/30-40/02-stranglethorn-vale).
#   Call of Air's follow-ups (Elemental Aid to The Tempest's Weapons, 33-40)
#   are in forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde: Forever moved Elemental
#   Aid's start (79360) to Prate, so his step points there.
# - Warlock: the Felhunter chain (2996/3001, 1801, 1803, 1805, 1795) runs
#   between Orgrimmar, Ratchet, the Undercity, the Hillsbrad coast, Thousand
#   Needles and the Wetlands: a long standalone chain, in
#   forever/class/warlock/felhunter-horde. Its Orgrimmar, Ratchet, Undercity
#   and Moldy Tome steps left this guide for it.
# - Warrior: Berserker Stance (The Islander 1718, The Affray 1719) waits for
#   forever/horde/30-40/03-arathi-highlands: Big Will is level 33.
#
# Class training: Orgrimmar at 30 and 32 for everyone but Druids and
# Paladins. Druids fly to Thunder Bluff at 30 (from Orgrimmar) and at 32
# (from Shadowprey Village); Paladins train in Thunder Bluff at 30 and with
# Garen Largo in the Undercity at 32.
#
# Carried on: Hunting in Stranglethorn (5763) for Hemet Nesingwary in the
# next guide; The Hammer May Fall (676) for Hammerfall and Regthar Deathgate
# (1361) for the Barrens, later on the route.
#
# Skyborne: Exploring the Horde (93739, from Thrall in forever/horde/03-
# silverpine-forest; its four leader visits end in forever/horde/07-
# ashenvale) is handed to Thrall on the Orgrimmar stop at the start; it is
# optional there, as in those guides.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Orgrimmar

step Fly to Orgrimmar
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip From Freewind Post, fly to Orgrimmar.
  fly "Orgrimmar"

step Alliance Relations
  tip Craven Drok waits in the Drag; Keldran stands in the Valley of Spirits on the west side of the city. Skyborne: Thrall waits in Grommash Hold, in the Valley of Wisdom.
  accept 1431                         -- Craven Drok
  turnin 1431                         -- Keldran
  accept 1432
  turnin 93739 optional only Skyborne -- Thrall, Grommash Hold, if you carry it

step Train
  only Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock
  tip Train your new spells.
  train class

step Thunder Bluff
  only Druid,Paladin
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Your trainer is in Thunder Bluff, one flight away: Turak Runetotem (Druids) on Elder Rise, Alodan the Hopeful (Paladins). Fly on to Sun Rock Retreat from there.
  fly "Thunder Bluff"
  train class

step Orgrimmar class quests
  only Shaman
  tip Searn Firewarder stands in the Valley of Wisdom.
  accept 1531                         -- Searn Firewarder

step Ratchet
  only Shaman
  zone The Barrens
  tip Fly to Ratchet. Islen Waterseer camps on the coast a short ride south of the town.
  fly "Ratchet"
  turnin 220                          -- Islen Waterseer
  accept 63

step Prate Cloudseer
  only Shaman
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip Fly to Freewind Post. Prate Cloudseer hides in a small cave in the canyon wall north-east of the post.
  fly "Freewind Post"
  turnin 1531                         -- Prate Cloudseer: your Air Totem
  note Prate also starts Elemental Aid (Razorfen Kraul), the 33-40 chain to The Tempest's Weapons: forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde.

step Fly to Sun Rock Retreat
  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  fly "Sun Rock Retreat"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The way in

step Gizelton caravan
  zone Desolace
  tip Follow the road south-west out of Sun Rock into Desolace and on south past Nijel's Point. Cork Gizelton's kodo caravan waits by the road north of Kolkar Village; if it has already left, ride on.
  accept 5821 optional                -- Cork Gizelton

step Bodyguard for Hire
  tip The caravan rolls south past Kolkar Village. Kolkar raiders ambush it in waves: kill them before they reach Cork. It stops by Scrabblescrew's Camp, east of Ghost Walker Post.
  complete 5821 optional

step Scrabblescrew's Camp
  turnin 5821 optional                -- Smeed Scrabblescrew
  accept 5561

step Ghost Walker Post
  tip Felgur stands in the post; Takata Steelblade and Maurin Bonesplitter wait on the rise west of it, above the Kodo Graveyard.
  accept 1365                         -- Felgur Twocuts
  turnin 1432                         -- Takata Steelblade
  accept 1433
  accept 1434
  turnin 1433                         -- Maurin Bonesplitter
  accept 1435

step Kodo Roundup
  tip Use Smeed's Kodo Kombobulator on an Aged, Dying or Ancient Kodo in the graveyard and walk the tamed kodo back to Smeed. Five kodos, one at a time.
  goto 52.0,57.5 "Kodo Graveyard"
  complete 5561
  turnin 5561                         -- Smeed Scrabblescrew

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North-east

step Khan Dez'hepah
  tip Ride north-east to Kolkar Village. Khan Dez'hepah (35) walks among the tents on the east side with a Battle Lord or two (32-33): clear around him, then pull him alone at full health.
  collect 6066 quest 1365

step Sargeron
  tip North along the eastern hills, the satyrs hold the ruins of Sargeron. The Shadowstalkers walk unseen; the four kinds you need do not.
  kill 4670 quest 1434.1
  kill 4672 quest 1434.2
  kill 4673 quest 1434.3
  kill 4675 quest 1434.4

step Thunder Axe Fortress
  tip Ride west to Thunder Axe Fortress. Beat a Burning Blade cultist down, then use the Burning Gem on it before it dies to fill one Infused Burning Gem. They also drop a Flayed Demon Skin now and then (1-5%); if one drops, read it.
  collect 6435 quest 1435
  collect 20310 x1 optional
  accept 1480 optional

step Ghost Walker Post
  tip Ride back south to the post.
  turnin 1435                         -- Maurin Bonesplitter
  turnin 1480 optional
  accept 1481 optional
  turnin 1434                         -- Takata Steelblade
  turnin 1365                         -- Felgur Twocuts
  accept 1366
  note Takata's next Alliance Relations sends you back to Orgrimmar for nothing: leave it.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Kolkar ears

step Kolkar ears
  tip Back at Kolkar Village, every Kolkar can drop an ear.
  collect 6067 quest 1366

step Shadowstalker scalp
  tip The Hatefury Shadowstalkers at Sargeron walk unseen until they strike; about one in three carries a scalp.
  goto 72.4,18.0 "Sargeron"
  collect 6441 quest 1481 optional

step Ghost Walker Post
  turnin 1366                         -- Felgur Twocuts
  turnin 1481 optional                -- Maurin Bonesplitter
  accept 1482 optional
  vendor nearest

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The west coast

step Shadowprey Village
  tip Ride south-west to the troll village on the coast, keeping clear of the Gelkis Village on the way.
  getfp "Shadowprey Village"
  accept 5763                         -- Roon Wildmane: for Hemet Nesingwary in Stranglethorn
  accept 6142                         -- Mai'Lahii

step Clam beds
  tip Ride north up the coast. Giant Softshell Clams lie in the shallows and the Enraged Reef Crawlers walk the beach; open each clam in your bags for its meat.
  collect 15924 quest 6142

step Slitherblade Oracles
  tip Keep north to Sar'theris Strand. The Oracles stand among the other naga at its north end; pull one at a time.
  goto 28.5,8.5 "Sar'theris Strand"
  collect 6442 quest 1482 optional

step Ethel Rethor
  tip Azore Aldamort waits in the ruined tower of Ethel Rethor, inland to the south-east.
  accept 5741                         -- Azore Aldamort

step Burning Blade Seer
  tip The Seer stands on the south side of Thunder Axe Fortress, east of Ethel Rethor. Clear the cultists around it first.
  collect 15750 quest 5741 @55.2,30.1

step Ethel Rethor
  turnin 5741                         -- Azore Aldamort
  note His next errand is not on this route.

step Ghost Walker Post
  tip Ride south-east to the post.
  turnin 1482 optional                -- Maurin Bonesplitter
  accept 1484 optional
  turnin 1484 optional                -- Takata Steelblade
  note Takata's next errand sends you after a demon lord with an elite guard: skip it.

step Gelkis Village
  tip Ride south-west towards Shadowprey. The Gelkis centaurs (32-35) around their village are a good camp; fight them until level 32.
  level 32 -- grind on Gelkis Stampers and Windchasers at the Gelkis Village, Desolace

step Shadowprey Village
  turnin 6142                         -- Mai'Lahii

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- To Tarren Mill

step Thunder Bluff
  only Druid
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Fly to Thunder Bluff from Shadowprey and train with Turak Runetotem on Elder Rise, then fly on to Orgrimmar.
  fly "Thunder Bluff"
  train class

step Fly to Orgrimmar
  zone Orgrimmar
  fly "Orgrimmar"                     -- Shadowprey Village flight master
  train class only Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock

step Zeppelin to the Undercity
  zone Durotar
  tip Leave Orgrimmar by the main gate; the zeppelin tower stands just north-east of it. Take the Undercity zeppelin.
  goto 50.8,13.5 "Zeppelin tower"

step Garen Largo
  only Paladin
  zone Undercity
  tip Garen Largo trains Paladins in the Undercity.
  train class

step Brazier of Everfount
  only Shaman
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip Do your shopping in the Undercity first, then fly to the Sepulcher. The Brazier of Everfount stands on the hill just south-west of it: beat the Corrupt Manifestation of Water beside it, place its bracers in the brazier, speak to the Minor Manifestation of Water and keep the Shard of Water for Islen. Fly on to Tarren Mill from the Sepulcher.
  fly "The Sepulcher"
  collect 7812 quest 63.1
  turnin 63                           -- Brazier of Everfount
  accept 100
  turnin 100                          -- Minor Manifestation of Water
  accept 96                           -- for Islen Waterseer: from Stranglethorn, next guide

step Undercity
  zone Undercity
  tip Elixir of Agony needs a Strong Troll's Blood Potion, an Alchemy item: buy one at the auction house here if you can (or ask an alchemist). No potion: skip the Elixir steps in Hillsbrad.
  note Strong Troll's Blood Potion: auction house or an alchemist, for Elixir of Agony.
  fly "Tarren Mill"                   -- Michael Garrett, the bat handler

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Tarren Mill

step Tarren Mill
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  sethome "Tarren Mill"
  buy 3703 x1 npc 2388                -- Southshore Stout, for Henchman Valik
  accept 552                          -- Novice Thaivand
  accept 544                          -- Magus Wordeen Voidglare
  accept 556                          -- Keeper Bel'varil
  accept 676                          -- Tallow: for Hammerfall in Arathi, later on the route
  accept 533                          -- Krusk
  accept 1361                         -- Krusk: for the Barrens, later on the route

step Daggerspine naga
  tip Ride south, east of Southshore, down to the coast. The Daggerspine naga line the shore south-east of the town.
  goto 53.0,65.0 "Daggerspine shore"
  collect 3509 quest 515.2 optional

step Torn Fin murlocs
  tip Follow the shore west past Southshore's bay; the Torn Fin murlocs camp on the beaches beyond it.
  goto 36.0,68.0 "Torn Fin beach"
  collect 3510 quest 515.3 optional

step Apothecary Lydon
  tip Ride back north to Tarren Mill, keeping west of Southshore.
  turnin 515 optional                 -- Apothecary Lydon
  accept 517 optional

step Shindigger keg
  tip The keg stands with a few others at the Syndicate camp on the south-east coast of Hillsbrad.
  collect 3517 quest 517 optional @72.0,80.5

step Back to Tarren Mill
  tip Hearth back (or ride north if it is on cooldown).
  hearth "Tarren Mill"
  turnin 517 optional                 -- Apothecary Lydon
  accept 524 optional
  turnin 524 optional                 -- Place the Tainted Keg on the Dusty Rug beside the inn

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Valik, yetis, Dalaran

step Henchman Valik
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip Follow the road north out of Tarren Mill into the Alterac foothills. Valik waits by the Syndicate camp; hand him the stout.
  accept 535
  turnin 535

step Syndicate missives
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip The Syndicate Footpads and Thieves (32-33) around the camps west of the road carry the missives; about one in three drops one.
  collect 3601 quest 533

step Helcular's Rod
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip South-west, the Cave and Ferocious Yetis (30-31) fill the caves in the hills west of Tarren Mill; about one in sixteen carries the rod.
  collect 3708 quest 552

step The Dalaran traitors
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip Head west along the foot of the mountains to the violet dome of Dalaran. Ricter, Alina and Dermot (33-34) stand together inside the crater's eastern rim, Kegan Darkmar (35) a little west of them; each carries one Bloodstone piece. The Shield Guards and Theurgists (31-32) around them drop the Worn Stone Tokens.
  collect 3689 quest 544.2            -- Ricter
  collect 3690 quest 544.3            -- Alina
  collect 3691 quest 544.1            -- Dermot
  collect 3688 quest 544.4            -- Kegan Darkmar
  collect 3714 quest 556

step Tarren Mill
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Ride back east to Tarren Mill.
  turnin 533                          -- Krusk
  accept 503
  turnin 552                          -- Novice Thaivand
  turnin 544                          -- Magus Wordeen Voidglare
  turnin 556                          -- Keeper Bel'varil
  note Thaivand's next task ends at Southshore's graveyard and the magus offers a dungeon errand: leave both.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Strahnbrad

step Gol'dir
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip Ride north past Valik's camp to Strahnbrad, the Syndicate-held village (35-37). Jailor Borhuin carries the Rusted Iron Key; Gol'dir sits in a cage in the house on the north side.
  collect 3704 quest 503.1
  turnin 503                          -- Gol'dir
  accept 506

step Tarren Mill
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Ride back south to Tarren Mill.
  turnin 506                          -- Krusk

step Fly to the Undercity
  zone Undercity
  tip The next guide starts in the Undercity, at the Grom'gol zeppelin.
  fly "Undercity"
